ow. <br /> <br /> Detroit Rock City: <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/showthread.php?446663-Werewolf-The-Forsaken-quot-Detroit-Rock-City-quot\" target=\"_blank\">https://forum.rpg.net/showthread.php...Rock-City-quot</a><br /> The Ties that Bind: <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/showthread.php?378138-Werewolf-the-Forsaken-quot-The-Ties-That-Bind-quot\" target=\"_blank\">https://forum.rpg.net/showthread.php...That-Bind-quot</a><br /> The Seventh Seal: <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/showthread.php?775548-Werewolf-the-Forsaken-The-Seventh-Seal\" target=\"_blank\">https://forum.rpg.net/showthread.php...e-Seventh-Seal</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9001-solidork","name":"solidork","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"178"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-23T10:52:47-07:00","id":1198753,"title":"","content":"In case this list is still being updated at some point...<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1178836-actual-play-vtr-gotham\">Vampire The Requiem: Gotham</a><br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Gotham is a city of towering heights that casts dark shadows over its populace, and the vampires of this city like it that way. A group of young kindred are brought together in a botched, magically aided assassination attempt and head out into the night to figure out who wants them dead, and why. Join us with Sarah as she tries to discover her Sire, Adam as he builds his occult clout, Thomas walking the edge between his old and new life, and Jack Steel making the best of the bizzare conspiracy around him. </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23776-raktus","name":"Raktus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"21"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-23T18:50:12-07:00","id":1198928,"title":"","content":"There are three actual plays on the vampire forum, mine isn't as good as I hoped it would be but I love Bloodlines in Requiem.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4714-live-bait","name":"Live Bait","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"703"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-28T18:47:28-07:00","id":1327998,"title":"","content":"I did not realize this thread existed:<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/852858-vampire-the-requiem-%E2%80%93-bloodlines-ap\">Vampire: The Requiem \u2013 Bloodlines</a><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><b>Social justice vampire/freelancer | He/Him</b><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Actual Play:</b></span> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/852858-vampire-the-requiem-%E2%80%93-bloodlines-ap\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire: The Requiem \u2013 Bloodlines</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Masquiem:</b></span> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/5268-13-licks-the-curses-of-caine-in-blood-smoke\" target=\"_blank\">Curses of Caine in Requiem 2nd</a